1.why we use import.meta.env not process.env ?

Because In Vite process is undefine in browser. and also
process have security issue and production break in that if we use process.env secret-key may get leak.
so vite support import.meta.env.

2.What is import.meta.env?

It gives me all information about environment variable to the package.

3.why Browser not support?

Because if browser read all of secret key will be leak. so browser not support to run nodejs.
nodejs has os level Access which Browser Block Them.

4.Why in React proceess.env work while same not work in Other?

Because in React is uses webpack module which plugin them .
while vite does not uses webpack packages . Although if we want to use them.
we should environment Plugin then we can use process.env in vite , but security risk always there.

5. Why no problem occur in use import.meta.env , why it work ?

Vite first read the value then replace them then after send to browser so it's safe to use.
no problem occur in import.meta.env.
